    },
    "body": "The compiler trained contradictory span labels on query/NONE branches that serving never evaluates. Condition span learning and native development selection on labelled writes, with an explicit write-row mean; keep all act/role credit and final false-write evaluation. Legacy all-row replay remains default. Native predictor/artifact format unchanged. Crossed-2 preserves training/development/factors and freezes new held-out inputs.\n\nSix actual fits (three paired head seeds per geometric arm) improve selected development writes to46–62/64. Matched familiar-wording/new-value writes48→205/384 and repetitions8→65/96. Product development store11/12 remains distinct from selected consumption7/12 and full-bank5/12. All30 same-step act/relation packed arrays equal prior artifacts, isolating span changes at fixed checkpoints.\n\nUnseen wording still fails act/relation; all8 newfresh questions fail in everyhead. Learnedfresh readerNOT_RUN (zero calls). Reference correct compilation/store independently exposes later progression failure in selected records and first-token wrong-record ranking in full banks. No generalchat or geometry-superiority claim. Next: native ordered frame/prefix composition with same-information carrier control, plus actual natural cue/query geometric source binding.\n\nValidation:13library+10driver tests/release and6validfitsPASS on approvedLinuxCPU at13d10d222166a43f39623ec0588c2e02c4efac85. Reviewed 8608037b072a1ab27d5ea1069043146bd6b0a89b is documentation-only sinceexecution, codebytesidentical. Independent source review and133,922saved-artifact checksPASS; threeoutcome reviews; BPE/native/backward/BLAKE3 exclusions explicit. OriginalP1003 stopped0.322s byreportcap isretained/excluded; prospectivereport512→768MiB enablesonlymissingseedretry, no completedfit repeated. Complete416files757,758,064B SHAsetverified, iCloudverified. Source/executable/artifact/resource/seed identities and negatives in evidence. Claim-wording/whitespacePASS. GPUunused/Metalunavailable; GitHub compatibility statuses are acknowledgements, not tests.\n\nReferences #820, #1552. Shared GroundedSession files unchanged.\n",
